        {
          "text": "Monthly Reset",
          "bold": true,
          "color": "gold"
        },
        "\n\n",
        {
          "text": "The first 1.000.000 blocks in the End reset at the beginning of every month, including the Ender Dragon boss fight.",
          "color": "gray"
        },
        "\n\n",
        {
          "text": "This gives more players a chance to explore End Cities, collect their loot, and obtain Dragon Eggs.",
          "color": "gray"
        },
        "\n\n",
        {
          "text": "Players can build after the initial 1.000.000 blocks in the End without having to worry about their blocks resetting.",
          "color": "gray"
        },
        "\n\n",
        {
          "text": "Enhanced Dragon Fight",
          "bold": true,
          "color": "gold"
        },
        "\n\n",
        {
          "text": "The first Dragon Fight of each month is enhanced with an additional challenge.",
          "color": "gray"
        },
        "\n\n",
        {
          "text": "The details of the enhanced fight can change from month to month.",
          "color": "gray"
        },
        "\n\n",
        {
          "text": "The exact timing of the monthly reset depends on the availability of the server admins.",
          "color": "gray"
        }
      ],
      "width": 500
    },
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "contents": {
        "text": "                                                      ",
        "underlined": true,
        "color": "gray"
      },
      "width": 500
    }
  ],
